    pk:hasScore 4.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sick et al. (2006) WNT/DKK activator-inhibitor hair follicle spacing morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 53.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2002-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle.py` (55.5/100). The v1 baseline implements the 2D saturating Meinhardt-Gierer WNT/DKK reaction-diffusion equations on a 56x56 periodic grid and computes the linear dispersion relation sigma(k) and critical diffusivity ratio d_c = (sqrt(2)+1)^2 = 5.8284, but omits primary-to-secondary inter-follicular wave insertion upon 2x epidermal expansion (Sick et al. 2006 Figs. 3-4), omits K14-Wnt overexpression high-density clustering and Dkk1 transgenic enlargement/blockade phenotypes, runs no equal-diffusion negative control (D_w = D_h), and performs no computer-vision segmentation of the vendored Mus musculus follicle placode specimen image. Overall 53.1/100 (faithfulness 47.7, reproducibility 65.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 3cb5ea9; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 63, Morphological realism / specimen match 38, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 46, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 64, Reproducibility package 65. Output judged: docs/media/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle_comparison.png: rendered output of 2002-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle.py at 3cb5ea9, image/png, 202559 B, 1620×528 px, artifact_sha256 7c67c960f1efad08725a7de344f0d07e7fcddab65bbf8e9db801e9aacfcbdc22 (sha256 7c67c960f1efad08725a7de344f0d07e7fcddab65bbf8e9db801e9aacfcbdc22), spec_fingerprint b89c42d7be6f1e2a68cf568ccc651fde825a3fca205d98fa93823f3a02d4cc25. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: b89c42d7be6f1e2a68cf568ccc651fde825a3fca205d98fa93823f3a02d4cc25; artifact_sha256: 7c67c960f1efad08725a7de344f0d07e7fcddab65bbf8e9db801e9aacfcbdc22; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle/hair_follicle_placode_specimen.jpg=f48a7d76ae5984e5..., datasets/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle/paper_citations.bib=473c1747b6bcb451..., datasets/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle/scout_manifest.json=39fe775496e89c51..., datasets/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle_reference.json=e224bca31b91571c...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add runtime SHA-256 verification of all files in `datasets/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle/`, expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 7 quantitative measurements with reference values, CV/RMSE/r uncertainty, and negative-control delta, expose full CLI flags, and upgrade the comparison figure to a 9-panel publication synthesis.",
        "remediation needed: Implement Sick et al. (2006) Fig. 2-4 & Andl et al. (2002) transgenic phenotype suite in 2D: (a) Wild-Type regular placode lattice, (b) K14-Wnt overexpression high-density clustered placodes (elevated rho_w), (c) saturated enlarged/ringing follicles (elevated kappa & moderate DKK), (d) Dkk1 transgenic blockade (high rho_h -> 0 placodes), and (e) equal-diffusion negative control (D_w = D_h = 0.01 -> 0 placodes).",
        "remediation needed: Implement Sick et al. (2006) Figs. 3-4 primary wave (E14.5) -> 2x epidermal expansion -> secondary inter-follicular wave insertion (E16.5) showing de novo placode formation at the uninhibited midpoints between primary follicles.",
        "remediation needed: Implement automated computer-vision segmentation of `datasets/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle/hair_follicle_placode_specimen.jpg` (Mus musculus E12.5-E13.5 in situ hybridization placode array) to extract individual dark-purple stained follicle placode centroids, areas, and nearest-neighbor spacing CV, plus an allometric domain-length scaling sweep." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.31e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sick et al. (2006) WNT/DKK activator-inhibitor hair follicle spacing morphogenesis — Parameter expressivity: 44/100" ;
